WEBVTT

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:06.400
The nose...

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:11.150
It confused your nose for your eyes and enlarged it.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.730
Is this what I get for trying to change?

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.570
Hey, that game looks perfect for you.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:28.290
No way, Yume. I'm too old to be playing something like that.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.670
What? Is Chisame the kind who's into bikes?

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.300
She's even won races and stuff.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.030
You can ride bikes? Ain't that cool?!

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.240
この坂を上り切ったら
kono saka o noborikittara

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:04.210
必ず見える景色が好きだって
kanarazu mieru keshiki ga suki datte

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:04.250
必ず見える景色が好きだって

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:10.380
背中に羽を持つあの子も言って笑ってた
senaka ni hane o motsu ano ko mo itte waratteta

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.050
ドキドキが一瞬で
dokidoki ga isshun de

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:18.140
トキメキになっていくんだなんて
tokimeki ni natteikunda nante

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:21.850
あの頃は信じられなくて
ano koro wa shinjirarenakute

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:26.810
ただ見惚れていたよ
tada mitoreteita yo

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.440
このスピードに乗せた体温が
kono supiido ni noseta taion ga

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:35.190
今全身で伝う　通じ合う
ima zenshin de tsutau tsuujiau

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.820
物語の鍵はこの手に
monogatari no kagi wa kono te ni

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:42.330
ぎゅっと強く握っているから
gyutto tsuyoku nigitteiru kara

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:46.040
感じて　応えて　風になる
kanjite kotaete kaze ni naru

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.710
空に溶けて海を抱きしめる
sora ni tokete umi o dakishimeru

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:53.630
新しい世界が見えるはず
atarashii sekai ga mieru hazu

00:01:53.920 --> 00:02:00.720
さぁ確かめに行ってみよう
saa tashikame ni ittemiyou

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:14.570
Juniors!!
Episode 10

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.570
I can't even reach.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:18.780
And it's just a game.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.160
The brake is loose.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.910
Can't expect quality out of this game.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.660
To a rider like me,

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.670
this low-quality game is nothing.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.300
I'll play it seriously.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:45.430
First corner...

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.270
Hang on.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.440
Hit the gas and get it straight.

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.150
Huh? It won't straighten.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.270
I need to get back on the course.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:01.820
No!

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:03.450
Burning! I'm burning!!

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:06.580
Mommy!

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.870
Yume...

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:12.420
Uh, that was...

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:15.500
I knew I heard Chisame-chan's voice!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.880
Oh, Onee-chan, everyone.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.840
You looked as if you were inside the game.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.260
This is image training.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:27.560
You recreate a race in your mind.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.270
Huh... So you even practice crashing?

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:35.860
Got it!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:39.280
When you have two feet
on the ground, it's pretty easy.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.410
Ah, I died.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.910
I made it to level three, though.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:47.660
Why don't you try, Chisame-chan?

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.870
I'm an actual racer.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.960
I could never put my feet
on the ground while I ride,

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.830
even if it's only a game.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.290
I absolutely refuse.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.710
Aryarya, I'm sorry.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.930
Even if I try, I can't get my feet down.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.970
I just can't take something
this embarrassing seriously.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.730
Move over, Shaggy!

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:16.400
In these kinds of games, you can't win
if you worry about how you look!

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.820
Yaaaaaay!

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:21.820
Forget what I said.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.910
Even if they can ride,
that doesn't mean they look cool.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.200
Did you just hear something weird?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:28.950
Huh?

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:37.880
I've memorized this bike inside and
out, as well as the course layout.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.750
My revenge begins here.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:40.760
Right!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:41.670
Left!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:46.930
Next...

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.850
Are you okay?

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.940
How did I crash while playing a game?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.780
Did the image training work?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.530
Are you hurt?

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.400
I-I'm fine.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.320
I'm a racer.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:12.500
It's a shame you couldn't keep going.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.710
I bet you feel like you haven't biked enough!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.380
This is my first time riding in tandem.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.800
It's alright, this is my first time too.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.220
Yume won't ride with me.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:33.350
It's dangerous to ride like that.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.640
I just stepped on with the wrong foot.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:38.190
Here we go!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:48.160
Well, how's your first tandem ride?

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:54.410
Raimu-senpai gave me a
ride the first time, too.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:07.800
Chisame-chan, it's a bit hard to ride
with you squeezing me like that!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:12.100
I-It's best to focus your center
of gravity near the middle.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.640
That's common sense for a racer.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.680
Oh, really?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.570
Nakano
Nakano

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.490
Morning.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.280
Morning, Chisame.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.120
About the race this year,

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.910
how about going a step up?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.200
Which race?

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:37.750
CBR250R Dream Cup.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:41.460
I guess you can consider it
your gift for starting highschool.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.920
A four-stroke, single-cylinder CBR, huh?

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:50.800
The CBR has a higher seat
than your minibike, though.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.720
I wonder if you can ride it at your height.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.270
I'll be fine.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.480
It won't matter once I'm moving.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:02.650
Besides, seat height is an
integral aspect of performance,

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.940
determined by the manufacturer after
a large investment of time and money.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.820
Just because you can't reach the ground
doesn't mean you should change that!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.740
Okay, so can I order this, then?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:18.790
Could you hold off on that order for a while?

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:24.920
Congrats on being promoted to Bike Club Captain!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.630
Oh my.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.970
I, Amano Onsa, humbly accept the
position as the Captain of the Bike Club.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.760
Yay!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:38.520
Anyhow, we, the Bike Club,
have a problem on our hands.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.140
We don't have new members!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:45.110
Out of everyone we've seen, I think
Chisame-chan would probably join.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:47.730
Yeah, but don't you notice something about her?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:51.820
She's stubborn, she's really
particular about bikes...

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.820
She's just like Suzunoki Rin!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:58.330
But the fact that she's so interested in bikes is good.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:00.620
And, she already rides.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.370
It's like...

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:05.880
If a duck came bringing
green onions, tofu, a pot,

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.250
and a portable stove!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.470
What did you want to talk about?

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:16.760
Since we're all bikers, we should all be friends.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:20.020
By the way, what's your family name, Chisame?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:20.930
Nakano.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.390
Nakano, huh?

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:26.060
Just like that former GP biker, Nakano Kinya.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:27.310
Sure.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.570
Wait, do you not know him?

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:33.240
He's pretty hot. He even calls
himself the Handsome Rider.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.870
That's my dad.

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:37.280
What?

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.160
For real?

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.000
Is that what you wanted to talk to me about?

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.670
Nah. The reason we brought you here

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:51.760
was to see if we could get an
actual racer to try out our bikes.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.720
It's alright to try them all.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:58.140
You're like a teacher to us when it comes to bikes.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.930
Please?

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.350
Based on the length of my legs,

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:05.850
and the weight of consumer bikes...

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.060
Whoops!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.270
You're dead meat.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.110
Um...

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:16.200
I choose to ride bikes only on circuits.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.910
Just mount one!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.910
You don't even need to go all the way!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.080
It feels like she's forcing me.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.870
What are you guys doing?

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.880
We're holding a bike test to get
acquainted with the first-year.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:33.760
Hey, Rin, give Chisame a chance
to try riding your Katana, too.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:34.630
What?

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.590
No way!

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:39.720
If you really want to, go buy your own.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.140
Don't take it personally,

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.020
but that's just how all bikers would act.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:48.940
Rin-senpai's comment just now

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:52.070
is a ray of light for me.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.230
All right.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.400
Fantastic!

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.780
You hear that, my senpais?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:02.240
A person who doesn't let others
touch their bikes is a <i>real</i> rider!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.750
I admire that.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:09.120
It's true that I <i>would</i> like to ride this <i>cool</i> Katana.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:11.880
But I shall restrain myself.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:15.300
For I am a <i>real</i> rider as well.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.130
You all ought to learn from Rin-senpai, too.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.390
You can't be so quick to let others ride.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.300
Huh?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.640
I'd rather not learn from Rin.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.640
I did it.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.850
I came up with that super normal excuse.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.650
If we're done here...

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:35.570
Are you sure?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:42.160
I-I'm saying if you <i>really</i> want
to try riding my Katana,

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.410
I'll let you.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.500
And if you admire me <i>that</i> much,

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:55.210
I wouldn't mind making a
"Team Secret Pigtails" with you.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:57.300
Oh Jesus.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.890
B-But it's your precious Katana.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:01.840
What?!

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.220
You've got me, a <i>real</i> rider,

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.850
telling you that you can try out my Katana!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.270
Be glad and get on!

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.560
What is she talking about?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.860
I hate to agree with Rin,

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.940
but we really have to ask you to try it.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:15.900
Yeah!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:16.730
Indeed!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:24.830
Get on! Get on!

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:25.280
Get on! Get on!

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.160
It's over.
Get on! Get on!

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:30.250
If I don't get on, this won't end.
Get on! Get on!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.370
But if I do, it's the end of me!
Get on! Get on!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:35.840
Ew, she can't even touch the ground.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.670
I win first place in minibike races.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:41.010
I can't let myself be humiliated like this!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:44.090
What do I do?

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.430
What do I do? What do I do?
Get on! Get on!

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:47.140
Get on! Get on!

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:51.350
Oh, all right, fine! Fine!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.980
Yeah, I'm so short,

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:56.480
I can't reach the ground when I'm on a bike.

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:58.900
There, are you happy?

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.070
Laugh all you want!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.120
Oh, don't take it the wrong way.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:13.750
Listen, that's totally normal for us girls.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.250
Try getting on my bike.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.800
But...

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.840
Huh?

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:24.970
I got them to make the
seat thinner and other things.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:29.720
Now try my Serow.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:35.190
It goes so low.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.070
The suspension is so loose.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.110
What's wrong?

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:40.820
How am I

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:44.740
supposed to take on corners with this?

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.820
I can't ride a bike like this,

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.160
even if the seat's lower.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:53.080
Besides, the seat height is something
decided by the manufacturer,

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.330
and is important for performance.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:13:00.630
Even if that means I can't reach the
ground, even if it means I can't ride,

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.220
it shouldn't be changed.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.140
Chisame...

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:12.430
Are you going to let the manufacturer
tell you what you can and can't do?

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.980
If you want to ride, then find a way to ride.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.480
No need to be stubborn about it.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:26.360
You don't need to be stubborn or worry
about how you look when you're riding.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.410
Just be you.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.830
I...

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.170
I would look stupid

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:43.590
making slick comments while riding this!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.840
Well, that's true.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.340
But keep being stubborn,

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.510
and you'll end up like that!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:52.220
Huh?!

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.310
You still have time!

00:13:58.560 --> 00:13:59.940
I'm home.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.020
Welcome home.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.520
Welcome home, Chisame.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:04.280
Hey...

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:08.660
I guess I'm going to be joining the Bike Club.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.910
So instead of that new bike we
were talking about this morning,

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:16.210
is it okay if I get a bike license?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.250
Well, I think you should do what you want.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.590
Really? Thanks, Dad!

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:26.050
There, you see?

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.470
I told you she'd go out onto the roads.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.090
Fine, you win.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.970
I was so sure she wouldn't.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:33.260
Ba
kuon<i>!!
I was so sure she wouldn't.</i>

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.010
kuon<i>!!
Ba</i>

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.020
Ba
kuon<i>!!</i>

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.870
And she crosses the line!
Nakano Chisame takes first!

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:56.040
The pole sitter wins with a five second lead!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.540
It's such an overwhelming win,
it's not even fun to watch!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.880
What the hell <i>is</i> she?

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.000
She's just like Doohan!
TL Note: Mick Doohan is a famous Australian Grand Prix 500cc motorcycle world champion.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:08.220
Look, there's an article about Chisame's race.

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:10.590
She's so small, even though she came in first.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.850
She basically always wins,

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:15.390
so they don't even bother with her anymore.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.680
I guess that's what I normally do.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.730
What's this?

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.610
It's a training harness for GP riders!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.030
A double-edged sword that can either train
all the muscles needed for biking,

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:32.360
or ruin your physical balance with overuse!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.490
You defeated such a rival.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.240
As expected!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:40.790
I think getting your license will be a piece of cake.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:44.250
Oh, yeah! I bet Chisame
could pull off that thing.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.170
What thing?

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.500
The one-off exam at the testing center.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.840
Beats spending time at the training center, right?

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:53.140
You're a bike prodigy after all, Chisame.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.760
<b>Driver Licensing Driver's License Exams</b>

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.430
Number 1, please.

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:01.060
Okay.

